# Documentation and KB updates

**Last reviewed:** 2026-03-31

Substantive **create or update** work is not complete until related **documentation** under `docs/kb/` is updated.

**Required:** Follow [`docs/kb/maintenance.md`](../../docs/kb/maintenance.md) for what to update by change type (backend module, frontend domain, hooks, routes, cross-cutting rules) and **out-of-scope** cases.

**Before marking a feature complete:** Ask the user whether anything beyond [`maintenance.md`](../../docs/kb/maintenance.md) should be updated — for example a new [`.cursor/rules/`](../../.cursor/rules/) scoped rule, a new KB page, or an entry in [`docs/kb/anti-patterns.md`](../../docs/kb/anti-patterns.md).
